xiǎoxīn.","fr":"Il faut être prudent en toute chose.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, la forme de 凡 se lit comme un plateau ou un bassin, et certains y voient une voile. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit comme « le tout, l'ensemble », sens resté dans 凡是, « tout ce qui ». Il veut dire aussi « ordinaire », et on le retrouve dans 同, qui s'écrivait déjà 凡 au-dessus de 口 sur les os oraculaires.","en":"On oracle bones, the shape of 凡 is read as a tray or a basin, and some see a sail in it. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as “all, the whole”, a sense kept in 凡是, “whatever, all that”. It also means “ordinary”, and it turns up in 同, already written as 凡 over 口 on oracle bones.","roles":{}}},"烦":{"c":"烦","pinyin":"fán","lectures":["fán"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["火","页"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0471","L4-0228","L5-0053","L7-1042","L7-1043","L7-1044","L7-4803"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"agacé, contrarié ; déranger","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"agacé, contrarié ; ennuyeux"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"déranger, importuner"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你别烦我。","pinyin":"Nǐ bié fán wǒ.","fr":"Laisse-moi tranquille.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"这几天我很烦。","pinyin":"Zhè jǐ tiān wǒ hěn fán.","fr":"Ces jours-ci, je n'ai pas le moral.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"繁":{"c":"繁","pinyin":"fán","lectures":["fán","pó"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["𠂉","母","𠂉","乂","糸"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0232","L5-0557","L6-0261","L7-1045","L7-1046","L7-1047","L7-1048"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nombreux, abondant ; compliqué","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"nombreux, abondant"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"compliqué, complexe"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他的工作很繁忙。","pinyin":"Tā de gōngzuò hěn fánmáng.","fr":"Il est débordé de travail.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"反":{"c":"反","pinyin":"fǎn","lectures":["fǎn"],"niveau"