"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"commettre, enfreindre ; être pris de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"commettre : une faute, un délit ; enfreindre"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"être repris de : une maladie, une manie"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"谁都可能犯错误。","pinyin":"Shéi dōu kěnéng fàn cuòwù.","fr":"Tout le monde peut se tromper.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"范":{"c":"范","pinyin":"fàn","lectures":["fàn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","氵","㔾"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0184","L3-0273","L5-0510","L5-0689","L6-0268","L7-0848","L7-1065","L7-1150","L7-3687"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"modèle ; limite, cadre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"modèle, exemple ; limite, cadre"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"贩":{"c":"贩","pinyin":"fàn","lectures":["fàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["贝","厂","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-1066","L7-3560","L7-4561"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faire commerce de ; marchand","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"faire le commerce de"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"marchand, colporteur"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"饭":{"c":"饭","pinyin":"fàn","lectures":["fàn"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["饣","厂","又"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0047","L1-0099","L1-0100","L1-0242","L1-0373","L1-0383","L1-0458","L2-0156","L2-0772","L5-0203","L5-0320","L7-0191","L7-1063","L7-3003"],"chemin":{"hsk":165,"lire":153},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"riz cuit, repas","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"晚饭好了。","pinyin":"Wǎnfàn hǎo le.","fr":"Le dîner est prêt.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"饭 associe 饣, la nourriture, qui porte le sens, et 反, écrit ici 厂 et 又, qui donne le son : fǎn, proche de fàn. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit par manger, prendre son repas. Le sens s'est déplacé vers ce que l'on mange, le riz cuit, puis le repas lui-même.","en":"饭 pairs 饣, food, which carries the meaning, with 反, written here as 厂 and 又, which gives the sound: fǎn, close to fàn. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as to eat, to take a meal. The meaning shifted to what is eaten, cooked rice, and then to the meal itself.","roles":{"饣":"sens","厂":"son","又":"son"}}},"方":{"c":"方","pinyin":"fāng","lectures":["fāng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L1-0071","L2-0016","L2-0131","L2-0157","L2-0158","L2-0159","L2-0160","L2-0161","L2-0392","L2-0583","L3-0167","L3-0185","L3-0460","L3-0686","L3-0838","L4-0143","L4-0181","L4-0232","L4-0233","L4-0234","L4-0292","L4-0559","L5-0026","L6-0243","L6-0626","L6-0647","L6-1012","L7-0566","L7-0741","L7-1067","L7-1068","L7-1069","L7-2587","L7-2588","L7-2855","L7-3111","L7-3237","L7-3396","L7-3565","L7-3921","L7-4542","L7-4838"],"chemin":{"hsk":29,"lire":32},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"carré, direction, côté","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这个桌子是方的。","pinyin":"Zhège zhuōzi shì fāng de.","fr":"Cette table est carrée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"L'origine de 方 est discutée : le Shuowen jiezi y voit deux barques liées côte à côte, mais les formes anciennes ont reçu d'autres lectures. Pour s'en souvenir : sous un point et un trait, un trait descend vers la gauche tandis qu'un autre part à droite et se replie en crochet, comme deux chemins qui partent chacun de leur côté. Le caractère dit le carré, le côté et la direction, comme dans 八方, les huit directions.","en":"The origin of 方 is debated: the Shuowen jiezi sees two boats lashed side by side, but the early forms have been read in other ways. To remember it: under a dot and a stroke, one stroke sweeps down to the left while another sets off to the right and bends back in a hook, like two paths heading their own way. The character means square, side and direction, as in 八方, the eight directions.","roles":{}}},"芳":{"c":"芳","pinyin":"fāng","lectures":["fāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","方"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1126"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"parfumé ; bonne réputation","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"parfumé, odorant"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"bonne réputation, vertu"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"妨":{"c":"妨","pinyin":"fáng","lectures":["fáng","fāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["女","方"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0273","L7-1078","L7-1079"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"gêner, entraver","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"gêner, entraver, nuire"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"房":{"c":"房","pinyin":"fáng","lectures":["fáng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["户","方"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0101","L1-0102","L2-0747","L3-0188","L3-0189","L3-0190","L5-0129","L6-0051","L6-0270","L6-0556","L6-0757","L7-1080","L7-2400","L7-3122","L7-3904","L7-4624"],"chemin":{"hsk":155,"lire":141},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"maison, pièce","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"房 associe 户, la porte à un seul battant, qui porte le sens, et 方, qui donne le son : fāng, proche de fáng. Le Shuowen jiezi le définit comme la pièce située sur le côté. Le sens s'est élargi à toute pièce, puis à la maison entière.","en":"房 pairs 户, a single-leaf door, which carries the meaning, with 方, which gives the sound: fāng, close to fáng. The Shuowen jiezi defines it as the room set off to the side. The meaning widened to any room, then to the whole house.","roles":{"户":"sens","方":"son"}}},"肪":{"c":"肪","pinyin":"fáng","lectures":["fáng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["月","方"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-5352"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"graisse","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"graisse (animale)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"防":{"c":"防",