":"Zhè cì kǎoshì tā dé le jiǔshí fēn.","fr":"À cet examen, il a eu quatre-vingt-dix points.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 分 montre déjà un couteau 刀 sous deux traits qui s'écartent, 八. Le Shuowen jiezi l'explique par « séparer » : le couteau tranche et les deux parts s'éloignent. De là viennent les sens de diviser et de partager, et, pour les petites unités, la minute ou le point.","en":"On oracle bones, 分 already shows a knife 刀 under two strokes spreading apart, 八. The Shuowen jiezi explains it as “to separate”: the knife cuts and the two parts move away. From this come the meanings to divide and to share, and, for small units, a minute or a point.","roles":{"八":"sens","刀":"sens"}}},"吩":{"c":"吩","pinyin":"fēn","lectures":["fēn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","八","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1127"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ordonner, en composé","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"ordonner : en composé"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"氛":{"c":"氛","pinyin":"fēn","lectures":["fēn"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["气","八","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0640","L7-1128"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"atmosphère, ambiance","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"atmosphère, ambiance"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"纷":{"c":"纷","pinyin":"fēn","lectures":["fēn"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","八","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0243","L6-0471","L7-0225"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"nombreux et confus","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"nombreux et désordonnés, confus"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"芬":{"c":"芬","pinyin":"fēn","lectures":["fēn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["卄","八","刀"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1126"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"parfum, senteu